      "pdfPage": 129,
      "latex": "N_{pl,Rd}=\\frac{A_a\\cdot f_{yk}}{\\gamma_A}+\\frac{A_c\\cdot0{,}85\\cdot f_{ck}}{\\gamma_C}+\\frac{A_s\\cdot f_{sk}}{\\gamma_S}"
