      "latex": "N_{pl,Rd}=\\eta_a\\cdot\\frac{A_a\\cdot f_{yk}}{\\gamma_A}+\\frac{A_c\\cdot f_{ck}}{\\gamma_C}\\left(1+\\eta_c\\cdot\\frac{t}{d}\\cdot\\frac{f_{yk}}{f_{ck}}\\right)+\\frac{A_s\\cdot f_{sk}}{\\gamma_S}"
